/-- A `𝒩`-element is *arg-like* if every coordinate is total or `⊥` (true of all `argElem`). -/
def ArgLike (z : 𝒩.Element) : Prop := ∀ j, component z j = N.bot ∨ ∃ k, component z j = natElem k

